data: {"query":"他有哪些论文","query_type":"canonical_v2:A:answer","answer_text":"“他”具体指哪位作者，目前无法从问题中确定，因此无法给出某位作者完整的论文清单。不过，你提到的这篇论文本身信息是明确的：\n\n《The sum-of-squares hierarchy on the sphere and applications in quantum information theory》由 Kun Fang 与 Hamza Fawzi 撰写，发表在 Mathematical Programming，年份为 2020。\n\n如果你能补充作者姓名，我可以据此进一步梳理其论文成果。","citations":[{"type":"paper","id":"official-source-66d558bbd151483a","label":"The sum-of-squares hierarchy on the sphere and applications in quantum information theory","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10107-020-01537-7"}],"evidence":[],"clarification":null,"structured_payload":{},"answer_style":"llm_synthesized","citation_map":{"1":"official-source-66d558bbd151483a"},"suggested_followups":[]}

